<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-11-27T15:24:55.091Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:24:55 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;M23 rebels have withdrawn from the Bunia area but opened a new front near the Uganda border, pushing toward Uvira city. Ugandan forces are pulling out of a DR Congo town amid a diplomatic dispute, while Muhoozi Kainerugaba’s social media posts have angered the Congolese government. In Ituri, fighting forced WHO to evacuate its Ebola response team from a hospital, with the outbreak now exceeding 12,000 cases and a death rate near 50 percent. M23 fighters claim to have shot down a Congolese military aircraft that is now missing, and a South African mercenary pilot was captured. The conflict caused 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE41c3pyNUpqdzJkNnFJZHBBdzk1M0V4NjlOSVBGaExMS3pvZlFJRnFhT2hNU2pmc1dOTjJuZmRTQW1rb1ZYVDdXbGZGYUxHUW5CRkJ0ZGRyWHFZSFhES0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxQTjMtd1VVS0xrV282WFo1eGtwYWlRaUR0a2F1eC1VdFpfd3djUDdMTlhKRXBHWFpjZjQxeDZEWG9IOGg4WmdMdXJlVUMxMDFOUUlUXzdybGl2OFZCR21KYTBFblh2Y1hVbmRYQTdwSWR6cklaTXV6cDAxaG1acWJtbGUxU1hTR3VLSTJSN0hpb2lwZzZjc2Y0ckhhZ001LTZ6UUpVbm1BejJRVzM0czh5ZklZRHBBRVRVY1RxN1N0Y2t0ZzdfNmVv?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE5uQzZ2Z05RVGJOSUNFUUc5MkFqWG01c2FkQjA0TllLdGY2cGc2MFplakYwWFVlcGFiWVlIdy1FWnAzVkJIejNtMk9FU0Z2QWhfUXFVSW9Qd2UwV1JiaGlKRjVVYi1qZ0NYOE1yT1BTRlNRdGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE00WmxwSV9jNXZtSUVOamNZTVhyTm9PS3lCZXYwZFdCaHMycmNFZVJDc3VfUHBNNHp2VVZNaHRUVGdTUzh1TFNKWk54Y2NRNTBZc296bVhjVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPcVg1dVY3Wm5lLS1uX3lwZmRPMlY3NV9oUldqb213MjV4OXRjeVF2dHQxYWRFbVg5MEZKbVZzd0JFVl